        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{x^{9}}{y^{6}}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\n\\left( \\frac{x^{3}}{y^{2}} \\right)^{3} &= \\frac{x^{3\\times3}}{y^{2\\times3}} \\\\\n&= \\frac{x^{9}}{y^{6}}\n\\end{align*}$$",
